section#stemdeck.dark
  div
    h2 StemDeck × A³ Motion
    p.subline Four stems, four paths through the room, one beat.
    p
      | A moving stereo mix moves everything at once. StemDeck plays every track as
      | four stems and moves each on its own path through the room: one holds the
      | floor, one circles overhead, one breathes from wall to wall. And because
      | StemDeck can be the tempo master, every movement lands on the track's own beat.

    figure.setup
      img(src="./img/a3-setup.jpg" alt="Four StemDecks around the A³ desk and A³ Motion, each deck playing its own track")
    //- GIF (short loop): a vocal stem taking off overhead while the drums stay put, StemDeck's stem meters beside A³ Motion's channel row

    ul
      li four decks, on the A³ machine or on any other one over AES67
      li four stems per track, split from any stereo track — or stereo files as they are
      li each stem on its own path, moved by A³ Motion or by its own actions
      li StemDeck as Pro DJ Link tempo master — no CDJs needed
      li beat-synced movements, counted in bars

    a.more(href="https://a3-audio.github.io/a3-doc/user/stemdeck-with-motion.html") How to set it up
